# MFE envelope

- Envelope must not contain `accessToken` / `refreshToken`.
- Remotes must not read storage (STORY-P021-002 AC-003).
- `capabilities.api.request` is the only network path.
- Check contract version before mounting. Degraded UI must not leak fetch errors that include tokens.
